            <img src="https://quarterlylearnings.com/quarterly-learnings-logo@3x.png" width="64" height="64" alt="Quarterly Learnings" style="display:block;border:0;">
          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#14281D;">Hi Jordan,</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#14281D;">Thank you for enrolling in AI Tool Survey. We created a Quarterly Learnings account for you with this email address. Set a password to start reading the course.</p>
