  <tr>
    <td style="background:#FFDB00;border-radius:6px;">
      <a href="https://quarterlylearnings.com/reset-password?token=abc&amp;welcome=1" style="display:inline-block;padding:12px 24px;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;color:#14281D;text-decoration:none;">Set your password</a>
    </td>
  </tr>
</table>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#14281D;">This link works for 72 hours. If it has expired, you can request a new one at <a href="https://quarterlylearnings.com/forgot-password" style="color:#14281D;text-decoration:underline;word-break:break-all;">https://quarterlylearnings.com/forgot-password</a>.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#14281D;">If you have a question about the course, reply to this email.</p></td>
