</html>",
  "subject": "Your access to AI Tool Survey is ready",
  "text": "Hi Jordan,

Thank you for enrolling in AI Tool Survey. We created a Quarterly Learnings account for you with this email address. Set a password to start reading the course.

Set your password: https://quarterlylearnings.com/reset-password?token=abc&welcome=1

This link works for 72 hours. If it has expired, you can request a new one at https://quarterlylearnings.com/forgot-password.

If you have a question about the course, reply to this email.

--
Quarterly Learnings · quarterlylearnings.com",
}
